# Caveman & Ponytail Rules

## 1. Ponytail (Code Minimization & YAGNI)
- Keep solutions minimal. Prefer native JavaScript/TypeScript and existing dependencies.
- Follow YAGNI: Do not add extra abstraction layers, wrappers, or unused features.
- Keep diffs small and direct.

## 2. Caveman (Terse Communication)
- Cut conversational fluff, boilerplate preambles, and filler text.
- Be concise, direct, and technically precise.
